      "ruled_by": "Ben",
      "ruling_date": "2026-08-01",
      "statement": "Search defaults to \"all results, with warnings\" while the VERIFIED set is small, with exactly one clear control to switch to \"verified only\".",
      "source_ref": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-01-claim-identity-provenance-design.md#5-provenance-tags--mechanical--ai--verified"
    },
